Package: qrreader-lcd
Version: 3.5
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Uchida <uchida@local>
Depends: python3
Description: QR reader for CardputerZero APPLaunch
 v3.5: still results show the cropped source region with the decoded
 code framed in green (Left/Right switches between multiple codes);
 flow navigation (hint chip, stepper, phase cards) for the still flow.
 v3.4: full-resolution still shutter (Enter/Space) and main-resolution
 finder guidance; heavy scan/decode run in worker processes.
 Burst-stacking QR reader with manga-tone attention visualization,
 drawn directly on the built-in LCD (fb0). Engine shared with the
 desktop version; ZXing via python3 zxing-cpp (user site).
